  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kupulumutsidwa kwa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfumu Hezekiya atamva zimenezi, anangʼamba zovala zake navala chiguduli ndipo analowa mʼNyumba ya Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anatuma Eliyakimu, woyangʼanira nyumba ya mfumu, Sebina mlembi wa bwalo ndi ansembe akuluakulu, onse atavala ziguduli, kwa mneneri Yesaya mwana wa Amozi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwo anamuwuza kuti, \"Hezekiya akunena kuti, 'Lero ndi tsiku lamavuto, lachilango ndi lamanyazi. Ife lero tili ngati mayi woyembekezera amene pofika nthawi yoti achire akupezeka kuti alibe mphamvu zoberekera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwina Yehova Mulungu wanu adzamva mawu onse a Rabusake amene mbuye wake, mfumu ya ku Asiriya anamutuma kudzanyoza Mulungu wamoyo, ndipo Mulunguyo adzamulanga chifukwa cha mawu amene Yehova Mulungu wanu wamva. Choncho pemphererani anthu otsala amene akanali ndi moyo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuluakulu a Mfumu Hezekiya atafika kwa Yesaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesaya anawawuza kuti, \"Kawuzeni mbuye wanu kuti, 'Yehova akunena kuti: Usachite mantha ndi zimene wamva, mawu amene nthumwi za mfumu ya ku Asiriya zandinyoza nawo Ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamverani! Ine ndidzayika mwa mfumuyo mzimu wina kotero kuti akadzamva mphekesera ya nkhondo, adzabwerera ku dziko lake ndipo Ine ndidzachititsa kuti aphedwe ndi lupanga kwawo komweko.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabusake atamva kuti mfumu ya ku Asiriya yachoka ku Lakisi, iye anabwerera mʼmbuyo ndipo anakapeza mfumu ikuchita nkhondo ndi mzinda wa Libina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi imeneyi Senakeribu analandira uthenga wakuti Tirihaka, mfumu ya ku Kusi, akubwera kudzachita naye nkhondo. Choncho iye anatumanso amithenga kwa Hezekiya ndi mawu awa:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kawuzeni Hezekiya mfumu ya Yuda kuti: Usalole kuti Mulungu amene ukumudalira akupusitse ponena kuti, 'Yerusalemu sadzaperekedwa mʼmanja mwa mfumu ya ku Asiriya.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndithu iwe unamva chimene mafumu a Asiriya anachita ku mayiko ena onse, kuti anawawononga kotheratu. Ndipo kodi iwe nʼkupulumuka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodi milungu ya mitundu imene makolo anga anayigonjetsa, milungu ya anthu a ku Gozani, Harani, Rezefi ndi Aedeni amene anali ku Teli Asara, inawapulumutsa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodi mafumu a Hamati, Aripadi ndi mafumu a mizinda ya Sefaravaimu, Hena ndi Iva, ali kuti?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pemphero la Hezekiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya analandira kalata kwa amithenga aja nayiwerenga. Pomwepo anapita ku Nyumba ya Yehova nayika kalatayo pamaso pa Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Hezekiya anapemphera kwa Yehova nati, \"Inu Yehova Mulungu wa Israeli, Inu amene mumakhala pa Akerubi, Inu nokha ndinu Mulungu wolamulira maufumu onse a dziko lapansi. Inu munalenga kumwamba ndi dziko lapansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inu Yehova, tcherani khutu lanu ndipo mumve Yehova tsekulani maso anu ndipo muone, imvani mawu onse amene Senakeribu watumiza kunyoza Inu Mulungu wamoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Inu Yehova, nʼzoonadi kuti mafumu a Asiriya anawononga mitundu iyi ndi mayiko awo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwo anaponya milungu yawo pa moto ndi kuyiwononga pakuti sinali milungu koma mitengo ndi miyala chabe, yopangidwa ndi anthu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo tsopano Inu Yehova Mulungu wathu, tipulumutseni ndithu mʼdzanja lake, kuti maufumu onse a dziko lapansi adziwe kuti Inu nokha, Inu Yehova, ndinu Mulungu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yankho la Mulungu Kudzera mwa Yesaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yesaya mwana wa Amozi anatumiza uthenga kwa Hezekiya wakuti, \"Yehova Mulungu wa Israeli akuti, 'Ndamva pemphero lako lonena za Senakeribu mfumu ya ku Asiriya.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mawu amene Yehova wayankhula wotsutsana naye ndi awa:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2KI 19:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Namwali wa Ziyoni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2KI 19:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "akukunyoza ndi kukuseka iwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2KI 19:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwana wamkazi wa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2KI 19:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "akupukusa mutu wake kumbuyo kwako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodi iweyo wanyoza ndi kuchitira chipongwe yani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2KI 19:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kodi ndani amene wamufuwulira mawu ako",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2KI 19:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndi kumuyangʼana monyada?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2KI 19:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wachitiratu izi Woyera wa Israeli!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudzera mwa amithenga ako",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2KI 19:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "wonyoza Ambuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2KI 19:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndipo wanena kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2KI 19:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'Ndi magaleta ochuluka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2KI 19:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
